 are inside the path\, 123 km from its centre line: the star vanishes for u
 p to 41.6 s.\nClosest approach 04:44:14 IST\, give or take 1 s. The star i
 s 66° up in the E · dark sky.\nIt fades 0.1 magnitudes for up to 42.3 s 
 on the centre line\, and the path is 939 km wide\, give or take 19 km.\nFi
 nder chart\, the map and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/asteroi
 ds-2026-09#2026-09-28-1-ceres-708160
